    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command your squad in intense tactical battles against players worldwide in this competitive turn-based tactical RPG. One turn can change everything.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legion is an online turn-based tactical RPG that melds classic JRPG mechanics with modern competitive PvP. You control a team of 3 to 6 characters through epic fights with the teams of other players.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/f100710092f3fd376fa94919742d6829.poster.avif?t=1754992513\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/f100710092f3fd376fa94919742d6829.webm?t=1754992513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/f100710092f3fd376fa94919742d6829.mp4?t=1754992513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VAST TACTICAL ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a team of 3 characters: a <strong>Warrior</strong>, a <strong>Black Mage</strong> and a <strong>White Mag</strong>e.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warriors</strong> excel at melee combat with devastating physical attacks and high durability.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Mages</strong> wield destructive elemental magic that can set the terrain on fire, freeze enemy characters in place, and damage them from afar.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/ce1a8ffc5dd3ab8114c569cb53b6eebb.avif?t=1754992513\" data-has-big width=800 height=259 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>White Mages</strong> keep your team alive with healing spells while inflicting status effects such as Poison and Silence to enemy characters.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/3fc04f6d6c5a7422f436516fe15deb80.avif?t=1754992513\" data-has-big width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the get-go you can play <strong>Practice games</strong> vs AI or <strong>Casual games</strong> vs human players. As you play, you will earn <strong>gold</strong> and gradually unlock the content of the in-game shop where you can trade that gold for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consumables</strong>: items that your characters can carry in combat to heal themselves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better <strong>equipment</strong> pieces to boost the stats of your characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful <strong>spells</strong> to teach to your mages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New characters to expand your team!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/c00495aa9bee37206a678a26abb0bcea.avif?t=1754992513\" data-has-big width=800 height=337 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEEP CHARACTER PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play you will also gain <strong>XP</strong> and <strong>level-up</strong> your characters, allowing you to increase their <strong>stats</strong> how you see fit! Increase the HP, MP, Speed, Attack (melee damage), Defense (melee damage protection), Special attack (spell damage) and Special Defense (spell damage protection) in any combination you see fit to craft your ideal characters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/9696b5614435b8c2a80a11ec15bec6a5.avif?t=1754992513\" width=800 height=491 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightning-fast glass cannons with devastating attacks but paper-thin defenses?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-def and high-spe-def tanks?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-defense mage with lots of MP to be able to cast the most costly spells?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The possibilities are endless and for you to experiment with!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RANKED COMPETITIVE PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you feel ready, start playing in <strong>Ranked mode</strong> to climb the weekly leaderboards across 5 increasingly difficult leagues: Bronze, Silver, Gold, Zenith and Apex!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/1383d57204127323de473148fc1e5af8.avif?t=1754992513\" data-has-big width=800 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/7efddafbc012f3b7975589c000d7644e.avif?t=1754992513\" data-has-big width=800 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based PvP combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game shop (using in-game currency)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 game modes: practice, casual and ranked (+ play against friends)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command your squad in intense tactical battles against players worldwide in this competitive turn-based tactical RPG. One turn can change everything.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legion is an online turn-based tactical RPG that melds classic JRPG mechanics with modern competitive PvP. You control a team of 3 to 6 characters through epic fights with the teams of other players.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/f100710092f3fd376fa94919742d6829.poster.avif?t=1754992513\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/f100710092f3fd376fa94919742d6829.webm?t=1754992513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/f100710092f3fd376fa94919742d6829.mp4?t=1754992513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VAST TACTICAL ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a team of 3 characters: a <strong>Warrior</strong>, a <strong>Black Mage</strong> and a <strong>White Mag</strong>e.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warriors</strong> excel at melee combat with devastating physical attacks and high durability.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Mages</strong> wield destructive elemental magic that can set the terrain on fire, freeze enemy characters in place, and damage them from afar.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/ce1a8ffc5dd3ab8114c569cb53b6eebb.avif?t=1754992513\" data-has-big width=800 height=259 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stro