 src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/9696b5614435b8c2a80a11ec15bec6a5.avif?t=1754992513\" width=800 height=491 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightning-fast glass cannons with devastating attacks but paper-thin defenses?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-def and high-spe-def tanks?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-defense mage with lots of MP to be able to cast the most costly spells?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The possibilities are endless and for you to experiment with!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RANKED COMPETITIVE PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you feel ready, start playing in <strong>Ranked mode</strong> to climb the weekly leaderboards across 5 increasingly difficult leagues: Bronze, Silver, Gold, Zenith and Apex!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/1383d57204127323de473148fc1e5af8.avif?t=1754992513\" data-has-big width=800 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729580/extras/7efddafbc012f3b7975589c000d7644e.avif?t=1754992513\" data-has-big width=800 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based PvP combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game shop (using in-game currency)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 game modes: practice, casual and ranked (+ play against friends)</p></li></ul>",
